    add+=f'The full-stack FPR is{pc(raw["fpr"])}\\%({raw["fp"]}/{r["evaluated_unique_n"]}); category-wise activity and exclusions are supplied. This is an external false-alert assessment, not a parser fidelity gold standard: official483-dimensional target vectors do not exist for these reports. Missing telemetry can resemble absent behavior. The external benign executions and20 MLRan ransomware reconstruction reports have different acquisition protocols; overall accuracy, precision and AUC are therefore not estimated by pooling them.\n\n'
